WEBVTT

00:21:58.542 --> 00:22:00.934
to say to people, one,
this is a really useful app,

00:22:00.958 --> 00:22:04.143
it will alert you quickly
if you're at any risk.

00:22:04.167 --> 00:22:05.559
But two,

00:22:05.583 --> 00:22:07.893
to get to the kind of scale
we're talking about,

00:22:07.917 --> 00:22:09.518
you might have to say to people,

00:22:09.542 --> 00:22:11.809
"Look, we're slowly
going to come back to work,

00:22:11.833 --> 00:22:13.851
industry by industry, company by company,

00:22:13.875 --> 00:22:17.184
and the deal for you to come back
and break isolation,

00:22:17.208 --> 00:22:18.809
the societal deal,

00:22:18.833 --> 00:22:22.393
is that you have to be willing
to carry this app."

00:22:22.417 --> 00:22:24.934
And you could, for people
who didn't want to do that,

00:22:24.958 --> 00:22:26.851
I guess you could have some protection,

00:22:26.875 --> 00:22:28.809
you can't lose your job for that.

00:22:28.833 --> 00:22:31.393
But, I mean, can you picture
society making the choice